To use the Virtual Fly Brain Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool, follow these steps:
Open Claude Desktop, go to Settings, navigate to the MCP section, and add a new MCP server with the settings:
Server Name: virtual-fly-brain,
Type: HTTP,
Server URL: https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org.
Alternatively, use the Configuration JSON method or set up the tool with GitHub Copilot or VS Code.

```
{
"mcpServers": {
"virtual-fly-brain": {
"type": "http",
"url": "https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org",
"tools": ["*"]
}
}
}
```
